# Machine-generated files — hide from diffs + mark as generated on GitHub.
# Regenerate via `cd frontend && npm run gen:api`. Drift is enforced by the
# `gen:api:check` step in CI, so the file is always in sync with the backend
# OpenAPI schema; reviewing its ~57k-line diff line-by-line in PRs is noise.
#
# ``linguist-generated`` hides the file from GitHub PR diffs (collapsed by
# default) and excludes it from repo language stats. ``-diff`` tells git to
# treat it as binary for diff output — ``git diff`` shows a summary instead
# of line-by-line (use ``git diff --text`` to force a full diff when needed).
# No merge= directive: on the rare conflict just re-run ``npm run gen:api``
# and the CI drift check will verify correctness.
frontend/src/types/api.generated.ts linguist-generated=true -diff
